{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1027120001:0":{"text":"Petal! Thank goodness you're okay!","source_cn":"太好了，一叶！你没受伤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8F23D8D2D10A48F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027120002:1":{"text":"!!","source_cn":"！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F44BEC7C4E5784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027120003:0":{"text":"As long as you're alright... You scared me running around like that.","source_cn":"只要你没事就好，别再乱跑吓我了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DAD5E84A8E42955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027120004:0":{"text":"...!","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027120005:0":{"text":"Petal...? W-Where are you going?!","source_cn":"……一叶？你……你要去哪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8BFE12404D93DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027120006:0":{"text":"Wait... those two seem to be the glimmerblooms that attacked Damian just now!","source_cn":"等等……那两只好像就是刚才袭击达米安的荧荧花！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A88E0776075687","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027120007:0":{"text":"Calm down, Lorsan. They don't seem to want to hurt us right now.","source_cn":"洛桑，别这么激动。它们现在并没有想要伤害我们的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E674B3A523F0A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027120008:0":{"text":"They look more like...","source_cn":"看起来，它们更像是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB1A13B49C833F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1027120008":{"text":"They look more like...","source_cn":"看起来，它们更像是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB1A13B49C833F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027120009:0":{"text":"I see... I think they want to take Petal back with them.","source_cn":"……果然。它们……是想接一叶回去吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD282F5FE8EC2CD50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1027120010:0":{"text":"!!","source_cn":"！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F44BEC7C4E5784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027120011:0":{"text":"...It's happening faster than I thought it would. ","source_cn":"……来得好快啊，比我想象的还快呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9B9C8663454D4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1027120011":{"text":"...It's happening faster than I thought it would. ","source_cn":"……来得好快啊，比我想象的还快呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9B9C8663454D4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1027120012:0":{"text":"I... I'm not sad. I'm happy for her. ","source_cn":"我、我没有伤心，我在替它高兴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47ED5A0217E197CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1027120013:0":{"text":"...?","source_cn":"……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C15B5912CAA4C17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1027120014:0":{"text":"Don't look at me like that... We should be happy, right? You can finally be reunited with your family...","source_cn":"你别这样看着我啦……我应该替你高兴的，对不对？你终于能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944114E8D3C94660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1027120015:0":{"text":"!!\n...!","source_cn":"！！\\n……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CC886AF85E3A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1027120016:0":{"text":"Um... what is Petal trying to say?","source_cn":"呃……一叶是想表达什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204995F7E8B89925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1027120017:0":{"text":"...!\n!!!","source_cn":"……！\\n！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC18E13D49F77993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1027120018:0":{"text":"You don't have to try and comfort me, Petal...","source_cn":"……噗。一叶，你不用这样安慰我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25DB76315D4A63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1027120019:0":{"text":"Y-You go with them. It's time for you to go home.","source_cn":"你……你跟着它们回去吧。回家去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC881EA45E9C7A774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1027120019":{"text":"Y-You go with them. It's time for you to go home.","source_cn":"你……你跟着它们回去吧。回家去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC881EA45E9C7A774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1027120020:0":{"text":"It's hard, but I know this is for the best. ","source_cn":"当然舍不得……但是，让一叶回去才是最好的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE7915DE391312C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1027120023:0":{"text":"She's got her own family and friends to love and care for... it's a good thing! ","source_cn":"它有自己的族群，有同伴爱护它、关心它……这很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE60F777CBD907E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1027120024:0":{"text":"I know what it's like not to have a family... I wouldn't wish that on anyone...","source_cn":"我……我不想要它离开家人。没有家人的感觉，我最清楚了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AF086C6C53C3A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"Are you able to let go? ","source_cn":"你舍得吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8642022321F8AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_sa